    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "MOVEHOME ESTATE AGENTS...are delighted to present No. 44, a magnificent three-bedroom semi-detached extended home, spanning 113 m² / 1216 ft² on two levels. This bright and spacious home was originally constructed in 1955 and has been well-maintained by the same family since just a few years after it was built. The home is wonderfully positioned in a highly sought after established residential area and enjoys a fantastic west facing sunny garden that’s over 100ft long. No. 44 offers a wonderful potential to transform into your dream home, making it ideal for young couples looking to get their foot on the property ladder as it requires modernisation throughout.\r\n\r\nUpon entering, you are greeted with a welcoming entrance hallway that enjoys understairs storage. A generous front living room flows seamlessly into the adjoining dining area, creating a spacious and airy environment for entertaining or relaxing. Large, double-glazed front and rear windows flood the space with vibrant sunlight throughout the day. Both reception rooms enjoy fireplaces, and the rear reception room was extended with the kitchen. To the rear there is a fully fitted kitchen and breakfast room, with ample storage.  \r\n\r\nUpstairs and off the landing there are three bedrooms to include two double and one single and a tiled family bathroom. There is attic access from the landing and a hot press.  While the dwelling has been kept in good condition over the years, it would now benefit from modernisation and general refurbishment. \r\n\r\nThe rear garden is a real standout west-facing, large at approx., 90 metres in length and beautifully mature, offering excellent outdoor space for relaxing or gardening. There is a garage to the side with shared access and No.44 also has side pedestrian access. The front garden is equally well-kept, adding to the home's overall appeal with pedestrian access.\r\n\r\nThe location of this property is second to none and boasts all the features that are expected from such a fine address. Situated off Shantalla Road, Number 44 Coolgariff Road benefits from immediate access to every conceivable amenity. The Omni Park Shopping Centre that also features a cinema, major supermarkets, retail shops and restaurants is just minutes walk away. Beaumont Hospital is just around the corner and DCU is  located close by also. Dublin Airport is a 10 minute drive, and the area is also well served by public transport and is close to the M50 and the M1. Local schools include St. Fiachra’s, St. David's Boys National School, St. Aidan’s, Mercy College Beaumont and Maryfield Secondary School.\r\n\r\nEarly viewing is essential to appreciate all this wonderful home has to offer and by appointment with MOVEHOME ESTATE AGENTS ... 01-88 44 690"
      },
      {
